      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "边界一：输入输出指针固化\n\n• 图节点直接硬编码显存虚拟地址\n• 重放前须按地址原位 copy_() 填输入\n• 末段退出用 weak_ref_outputs 释放缓存",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2073651465,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1f",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "边界一：输入输出指针固化\n\n• 图节点直接硬编码显存虚拟地址\n• 重放前须按地址原位 copy_() 填输入\n• 末段退出用 weak_ref_outputs 释放缓存",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "updated": 1,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 30153865,
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "width": 275.92584228515625,
      "x": 26.037078857421875,
