      "index": "a5",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "边界二：静态 Batch 分桶与零分配\n\n• 动态请求填充 Padding 至离散捕获桶\n• 禁止图内按运行时维度动态 cudaMalloc\n• 复用全局 MemPool 控制显存峰值",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1484349417,
      "strokeColor": "#1d1d1f",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "边界二：静态 Batch 分桶与零分配\n\n• 动态请求填充 Padding 至离散捕获桶\n• 禁止图内按运行时维度动态 cudaMalloc\n• 复用全局 MemPool 控制显存峰值",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "updated": 1,
      "version": 3,
